          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05\"}}"
    - rid: 7133309421595918782
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '{"text":"Importa immagine","status":"machine","sourceHash":"da372261bd918e42761f107c10e0db9e82b9e429c158467eb893292b20067402","provenance":{"method":"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary","date":"2026-10-05"}}'
    - rid: 7133309421595918783
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "{\"text\":\"Impossibile connettersi. Per la LAN nel browser,
          apri questo sito in un\u2019altra scheda dello stesso browser, ospita l\xEC
          la partita, poi seleziona la stanza o inserisci qui il suo ID.\",\"status\":\"machine\",\"sourceHash\":\"c91825ff02019de802dc76b4b8b6cbf333b1d789a4279e88c88f64ab43f0afe7\",\"provenance\":{\"method\":\"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05\"}}"
    - rid: 7133309421595918784
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "{\"text\":\"Tutti i giocatori potrebbero dover caricare manualmente
          l\u2019ultimo .zip del gioco. Per assistenza: david@finoldigital.com.\",\"status\":\"machine\",\"sourceHash\":\"45b3c3bdb44974271fd21f4caaeba4c69abfe8adf1a64976e92234b5fe002bae\",\"provenance\":{\"method\":\"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05\"}}"
    - rid: 7133309421595918785
