          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary","date":"2026-10-05"}}'
    - rid: 7133309421595919217
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '{"text":"Impossibile copiare negli appunti. Riprova.","status":"machine","sourceHash":"d5a2d95e0c19fcc0d2340e70307aae6bc0f3c46ad34ed35b9d7563a8774743fd","provenance":{"method":"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary","date":"2026-10-05"}}'
    - rid: 7133309421595919218
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '{"text":"Impossibile confermare la copia. Prova a incollare
          per verificare o copia di nuovo.","status":"machine","sourceHash":"bb1dc1527229f23ae387371aa5fd8ad88f52b8dd07628ed26cd87e9049c5a700","provenance":{"method":"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary","date":"2026-10-05"}}'
    - rid: 7133309421595919219
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "{\"text\":\"Il testo di questo mazzo \xE8 stato copiato negli
          appunti.\",\"status\":\"machine\",\"sourceHash\":\"759c0a0d827331d2b4b1686b9d1f785656ee6a8cae900c7bd1350ec179b74238\",\"provenance\":{\"method\":\"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05\"}}"
    - rid: 7133309421595919220
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "{\"text\":\"Destinazione selezionata. Verifica l\xEC che
          il contenuto sia stato condiviso o copiato.\",\"status\":\"machine\",\"sourceHash\":\"eb3f6505ec2a8b8c2855caa3d54c05172f5ffa0c1f14d6e661e37a52ae94232b\",\"provenance\":{\"method\":\"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05\"}}"
    - rid: 7133309421595919221
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "{\"text\":\"Non c\u2019\xE8 testo da copiare o condividere.\",\"status\":\"machine\",\"sourceHash\":\"cc01f4d7753ebfc4e9841cd67af5f40c6503c19319e616a804d10573949b35f2\",\"provenance\":{\"method\":\"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05\"}}"
    - rid: 7133309421595919222
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '{"text":"Impossibile aprire la condivisione. Riprova.","status":"machine","sourceHash":"79e37518e7b4bd4034f8e9844735c4921bf394f24f4daa4906c8a0310f724beb","provenance":{"method":"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary","date":"2026-10-05"}}'
    - rid: 7133309421595919223
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
