          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary","date":"2026-10-05"}}'
    - rid: 7133309421595919228
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '{"text":"Benvenuto in CGS!\nIl sito CGS offre guide e risorse
          per i nuovi utenti.\nAprire il sito CGS?","status":"machine","sourceHash":"6ebc31ac05e2fe242d8efb95bf836827997ff3eb24af91dfb68a52de41006641","provenance":{"method":"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary","date":"2026-10-05"}}'
    - rid: 7133309421595919229
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '{"text":"Benvenuto in CGS!\nQuesta versione mobile affianca
          la versione PC di CGS, disponibile sul sito CGS.\nAprire il sito CGS?","status":"machine","sourceHash":"7b4d3ea637051f0761b5897e0d4e30858dac7559a3f81a1530d0b3409307b312","provenance":{"method":"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary","date":"2026-10-05"}}'
    - rid: 7133309422095302663
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '{"text":"#Incolla qui il codice del mazzo","status":"machine","sourceHash":"8ff58d46843bbda8a99b5e18968d1b67f8273d16db05f72f25b374da5b07f9dc","provenance":{"method":"Codex
